    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐδύμια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], τά,</span>
